{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ffa798e9d587a1fd90e3885d55334d3a70fb240ec597c6dff05695587a4410b9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e7de0bb1db2d84f336a0b3dd37d0ba38170ca2f25aaa849ad9776c6c664537e",
      "text": "特别生日蛋糕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a9487916628b2ab9561f05cef90202ada8167781a3ccba7f3539e95ff15c609",
      "text": "生日临近的某一天，幸广向庄一郎\n透露了生日派对的计划。\n被询问想吃什么、想要什么的庄一郎，\n提出了某个心愿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb0f9161df768e69de6295b64960f77142fe3859b69d58243a729c3c37935fdf",
      "text": "今天终于到了庄一郎的\n生日派对啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a703aa350fc866f12468406da75024ff0dcb629a15f27a44880cd645c457de27",
      "text": "时机已至！盛宴所需之满载罪孽诱惑的供物亦已精炼完毕。\n至高之时光已被许诺！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01c3322c841103fd75a0dc479cbdb3a546cdbe4b1ea0a546edc7effbdcc2911a",
      "text": "是的！接下来只要\n展示给庄一郎先生看就行了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fae682dec265060a68ed523e1da47520d3c4c46d42891f623113f6383939fe6",
      "text": "是啊。为了让东云开开心心地过生日，\n最后的收尾也加把劲吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1505b8ea4e3a91bd8a644f4f7f5b71cea5810874d1e200e728dd38d0fc5272b6",
      "text": "今天真是太感谢大家\n热闹的庆祝了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fd850ac47557dbb2306b42a2d49525c54a679e356919ef0f9cfe22e6f8d097a",
      "text": "你能高兴就太好了。\n毕竟是难得的生日嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8dda807d189a3be55ef34adc60946ac1a8cf3065b691016604a4d7bbd15958f0",
      "text": "听到你的心愿时我还不知如何是好，\n不过反复摸索尝试的过程也挺开心的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d393cafc2516b60b44d37b3b2977ee2d375c47d3b73848156abd09b560f0a8c1",
      "text": "呵呵。那么等神谷生日的时候，\n就由我来反复摸索尝试吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4c8a84dc0fd8054d5d7410d29b521dc48170e080d18bcc93ecc1214a6c4089f",
      "text": "要提什么心愿好呢。\n我会好好想想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25f250528df14068f38b6c28f9dc26180d2bcac635b6df4a4fafda8b6a8d6a68",
      "text": "庄一郎，看吧。\n此乃以甘美之暗夜之泪所刻下，撒旦之肖像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:385f25cdc087b19a6b482838d2e4c0164677e3ee6cee686c91979691529f16bf",
      "text": "哎呀，是在描图纸上\n画出来的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa920f40b59a9e6fb52f81ead0077fa89045d593577e2a7075b04c603e131036",
      "text": "呵呵，跟撒旦先生很像呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1caaa26661c493f9864b6872ba5a4a7a6c0e6592e17a1f44d092a1af1eebfdb2",
      "text": "正是如此。待下次契机，必将肖像\n亦铭刻于献予汝之满载罪孽诱惑的供物之上！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d06e6219afdada919fc64aba986896dc40f10943f7715b950e5ad14d07563394",
      "text": "一定会很可爱吧。\n呵呵，我很期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74eabf56623d4c7347aedb58de0e7f7c9d37899f662cc085151033ea4e67b7aa",
      "text": "你们为我做的蛋糕我也拍了照片，\n之后会时不时翻出来看的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5f7ab1ccaee79cb4bba29bea31b15129a24eb7b9fc789b0d7c27fad6cadc2ea",
      "text": "谢谢！虽然刚开始练习的时候歪歪扭扭的，\n但我有努力去做！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c79f46c460aaf667dd9cfa013cfcb31280f03f7d0dbf6a0784bfcf3d8156f639",
      "text": "谢谢你\n为了我做这些。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70ef757709701b7646fc06d4c5a5671c85ea694ef287a8450cffd3643e3e01a2",
      "text": "得到了大家的灵感启发，\n我觉得自己也能做出崭新的蛋糕了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60dd8d11badcaa00f7da14b85b5c385b25f47a4da8c278af95f6330d061a648a",
      "text": "真的吗！\n好期待呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dec07ee33bf54fe52693a7e7decad1cfa020fb856c4ed5e758e9a0dbead642b6",
      "text": "庄一郎的生日花虽然有好几种，\n但这次选了叫黄花石蒜的花哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5260bd701b0519336abb36ea0991e1c2b1a59ae7a5279cc9286c80ded4a3f542",
      "text": "小小的又黄灿灿的，\n啪噼地超级可爱对吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d40e14a0e0c9f2604f88821215e3af6e95333e5ad52b2fe6a1549f53187e51e",
      "text": "是这样啊。\n真是可爱的花呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6526cbb6789e14cb00732e86913750d1c33284feb50cf809a1174a0bf0f74b7",
      "text": "排了好多朵，简直像花束一样，\n真是个美妙的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_2_1_2_028_12:1_2_028_12_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f2a71dbb61487a1e786dab166e63d7608f9ccb0c3454ca5f8749776afe5b45c",
      "text": "感受到了大家的心意。\n呵呵，谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
